<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson signs deal with Telecom Finland.</title>
<headline>Ericsson signs deal with Telecom Finland.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group AB LM Ericsson said on Wednesday it signed a contract with Telecom Finland for its new ERION optical networking system, its first order for the system.</p>
<p>No financial details were given for the deal.</p>
</text>
